--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,6 +6,12 @@ An independent reproduction study of "Attention Is Not What You Need" (arXiv 251
 
 This repository contains a reproduction of Grassmann flow layers for sequence modeling. The original paper claims performance "within 10-15% of size-matched Transformers" on Wikitext-2. Our reproduction shows a **22.6% gap** - significantly larger than claimed.
 
+## Current Research Status
+
+The repository now also studies knowledge distillation from a heterogeneous Grassmann--Transformer late-fusion teacher into smaller students. After the CAC submission was rejected, the project returned to empirical validation. The immediate priorities are token-normalized KD, matched multi-seed controls, and branch-aware methods that address the observed negative transfer on TinyStories.
+
+Start with [the project map](docs/project_map.md), [the experiment catalog](docs/experiment_catalog.md), and [the post-rejection roadmap](docs/research_roadmap.md). The generated registry at `docs/generated/experiment_registry.csv` indexes all current run directories without moving or deleting historical artifacts.
